179		% (references/qpbt-paper/08_classical_and_quantum_low_degree_tests.tex:446-454),
180		% without checking that theorem's hypothesis k >= 12mt on the parameter.
181		% Inspection of the cited test (arXiv:2111.08131, Figures 1 and 2,
